1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:07,467
Then a flashlight beam sweeps the road
below. Three shadows. A man, a woman
and a small child, standing outside
the gate.

2
00:00:08,167 --> 00:00:13,800
Rule one. After seven, the gate stays
shut. I wrote that rule after nine
people died when I opened it at night.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,033
You can't leave them out there. It's
freezing.

4
00:00:17,733 --> 00:00:20,467
I can't open that gate. I'm sorry. I
really am. I can't.

5
00:00:21,167 --> 00:00:26,033
Below you, a toddler is crying. You
can hear it from two hundred and
twelve steps up.
